HRLY: Attention, Black Dogs! This is Commander Harley of the 3rd Platoon. NSDF Command has authorised my men to use lethal force if necessary. Stand down and surrender before this gets ugly.

SHAW: Any of you listen to that traitor and I'll shoot you for treason myself.

HRLY: Cameron Shaw! Still at it, I see? Turn yourself in now and we can avoid any unpleasantness. There's no need for anyone to get hurt.

SHAW: You know exactly what this is, George. You've betrayed your country. I won't let you get away with that.
